# Generated / local extract output (batch dumps, summaries)
/out/
out/
*.log

# Session payloads — may contain prompts, paths, tool args (never publish)
**/updates.jsonl
**/chat_history.jsonl
**/events.jsonl
**/signals.json
# Loose extract artifacts if written outside out/
*-events.jsonl
*-summary.json

# Local maintainer regression scripts (not part of the public tree)
